      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Integration Requirements for Advertising API",
      "Anchor": "integration-requirements-for-advertising-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Deprecation Notice:\nThe Marketing Version 202510 (Marketing October 2025) will be sunset on October 15, 2026. We recommend that you migrate to the latest versioned APIs to avoid disruptions. For information on all the supported versions, refer to the migrations documentation.\nIf you haven\u2019t yet migrated and have questions, submit a request on the LinkedIn Developer Support Portal.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Integration Requirements for Advertising API",
      "Anchor": "integration-requirements-for-advertising-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "LinkedIn is in the process of rolling out a Technical Sign Off process for the Advertising API program. This ensures that our members get the best experience whether using LinkedIn\u0027s native UI or a partner product. The technical review and sign off also ensures that there are no gaps in integrations and that partner products keep up with the latest features and updates released by LinkedIn.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Integration Requirements for Advertising API",
      "Anchor": "integration-requirements-for-advertising-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "As an API partner, please go through the requirements listed below. These are the capabilities that an integrating partner is expected to build in their product. We request you to plan and incorporate these features early in your design. When you\u0027re nearing completion, you must initiate a Technical Sign Off request by contacting your LinkedIn POC on the Business Development team.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Integration Requirements for Advertising API",
      "Anchor": "integration-requirements-for-advertising-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "A demo will be scheduled during which you\u0027ll be asked to showcase all your product capabilities. During this evaluation, LinkedIn can suggest modifications which should be completed for the sign off. If all criteria are met (as per the envisioned scope), the technical sign-off is awarded.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
